{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo allows you to experience the early stages of &quot;Do not respond\uff01&quot; for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the following specific content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Plot:</strong> Experience the game's opening storyline and learn basic moves, interactions, and combat mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Length:</strong> Approximately 3-10 minutes of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explorable Areas:</strong> 3 small independent areas within the &quot;Church Wasteland&quot; map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Systems:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon System:</strong> 2 different starting weapons are available, and they can be combined at a crafting bench.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy System:</strong> Features 2 different types of minions and 1 boss.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difference from the Full Version:</strong><br>The demo only covers the first minor chapter. It ends after you either defeat the first boss or are defeated by it. The full version will include over 6 larger maps, more than 5 weapons, a level-up system, a collection system, and a main story lasting over 3 hours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037270?t=1759512316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037270?t=1759512316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037270/c78b056f4c86b99ad811c2917c59b58998f7d078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759512316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037270/c78b056f4c86b99ad811c2917c59b58998f7d078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759512316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo allows you to experience the early stages of &quot;Do not respond\uff01&quot; for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the following specific content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Plot:</strong> Experience the game's opening storyline and learn basic moves, interactions, and combat mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Length:</strong> Approximately 3-10 minutes of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explorable Areas:</strong> 3 small independent areas within the &quot;Church Wasteland&quot; map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Systems:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon System:</strong> 2 different starting weapons are available, and they can be combined at a crafting bench.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy System:</strong> Features 2 different types of minions and 1 boss.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difference from the Full Version:</strong><br>The demo only covers the first minor chapter. It ends after you either defeat the first boss or are defeated by it. The full version will include over 6 larger maps, more than 5 weapons, a level-up system, a collection system, and a main story lasting over 3 hours.</p>","developers":["\u5343\u5e74\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4034270","name":"Do Not Respond\uff01"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037270/933b48e09929a715f80875711e7f8f698e0952e9/header.jpg?t=1759512316","is_free":true,"linux_requi